["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trump&#x27;s Super Intelligence Summit, AI Safety Accord, GDP Beats, Midterm Predictions White House Accord on Superintelligence D&amp;O policy K-shaped recovery Polymarket Atlanta Fed GDPNow\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-allin-ai监管下一步不是管模型-而是像配给电力一样配给算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/273ef7fb4c1e777b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>AI监管下一步不是管模型，而是像配给电力一样配给算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">弗里德伯格认为，模型每11天就迭代一代，根本管不住；真正能卡脖子的是GPU和服务器数量，政府迟早要出手分配算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力配给</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"509 – Court Costs Constitutio Domus Regis Exchequer crown-wearing ceremony plowshare\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-britishhist-英格兰改收现金税不是体恤农民-而是亨利要打仗方便/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>英格兰改收现金税不是体恤农民，而是亨利要打仗方便</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王室财务官菲茨尼尔说亨利把实物税换成货币税是体恤农民疾苦，但现金更轻便、不会腐坏，还能直接跨海雇佣雇佣兵打仗——这才是亨利真正想要的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪英格兰</span><span class=\"tag\">王室财政</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Using Decision Science in Investing: Masters in Business with Omar Aguilar Bayesian statistics BIAgnostics broker window momentum trade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-mastersinbiz-私募信贷的恐慌不是信用问题-根源是流动性被当成了收益/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>私募信贷的恐慌不是信用问题，根源是流动性被当成了收益</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你的钱没有违约，只是被锁住了几个季度；把私募信贷的流动性溢价误读成信用风险，是这轮恐慌的真正源头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为金融</span><span class=\"tag\">退休规划</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reintegration With the Default World 351 exchange heartbeat trade narrow banking substance over form X-risk\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-moneystuff-银行靠你懒得搬钱赚钱-ai-agent要把这招拆穿了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>银行靠你懒得搬钱赚钱，AI agent要把这招拆穿了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多银行产品定价假设储户不会频繁搬钱；一旦AI agent替你盯盘、自动把闲钱转去收益更高的地方，这类生意的定价逻辑会跟着松动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">税务筹划</span><span class=\"tag\">ETF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"19 Astra and &#x27;Hugging Face&#x27; details that reveal what&#x27;s coming next | Rob Wiblin chain of thought recurrent depth swarm\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-eightythousand-新模型学会少写思考过程-监控ai的最后防线正在失效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09f40d134028b0ce-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">20:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>新模型学会少写思考过程，监控AI的最后防线正在失效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI自己的测试显示，新模型Astra能不写推理就解开人类需三十分钟的数学题——意味着读它的思维文字，已经看不出它真正在想什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">思维链监控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"A 4-Track Mind ragtime\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-radiolab-他能在脑子里同时播放四首交响乐-专业指挥连两首都做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fb3312f6fc86942a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">21:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>他能在脑子里同时播放四首交响乐，专业指挥连两首都做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神经科学家用fMRI扫描验证：职业指挥同时想两首乐曲就彻底卡壳，这位拉格泰姆钢琴师却能精确报出四首交响乐此刻各自播放到哪一个音符。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span><span class=\"tag\">音乐认知</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Lager, Ale, Emo Girl ale lager animal magnetism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-stuffmissed-靠行善出名的历史人物-日记原稿里满是婚姻抱怨与酗酒痕迹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>靠行善出名的历史人物，日记原稿里满是婚姻抱怨与酗酒痕迹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传记作者核对原始日记后发现，她的女儿们在整理回忆录时抹去了对婚姻的犹豫、与婆家的摩擦，以及借酒精缓解焦虑的痕迹。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史播客</span><span class=\"tag\">啤酒酿造史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Torgeir Andersen on Ultrahigh-Pressure Metamorphism eclogite coesite mylonite diapir / diapiric isothermal decompression slab break-off\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-geologybites-大陆地壳能沉入地幔100公里-靠下方板片断裂才重新浮起/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0ea2e6d37daecaa7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">27:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>大陆地壳能沉入地幔100公里，靠下方板片断裂才重新浮起</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">挪威西部的花岗质地壳本该上浮，却被下方正在俯冲的大洋板片当作锚拖入地幔深处；板片断裂后浮力反转，地壳才沿原路径折返地表。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地质学</span><span class=\"tag\">变质岩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Agents Can Beat the Incumbents system of record RFQ should-cost modeling direct procurement principal agent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-a16z-系统记录里只有价格结果-真正的采购战争藏在系统之外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>系统记录里只有价格结果，真正的采购战争藏在系统之外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">采购价格数字背后，是几十场会议、几百封邮件和上千个供应商——AI原生公司的优势，是把这整段看不见的工作接管下来，而不只是记录结果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"689. Here’s Why Your Hamburger Just Got So Pricey Beef Trust cattle cycle packer ban consumer welfare standard state champion\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-freakonomics-牛肉越缺-解法却是让短缺先变得更严重/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">49:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>牛肉越缺，解法却是让短缺先变得更严重</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国碎牛肉价格创纪录，根源是牛周期的死结：要缓解牛荒，牧场主得先把母牛留着不卖不杀，让眼下的短缺先变得更严重，才能换来几年后牛群恢复。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">农业</span><span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frontier Chips for Frontier AI Labs, with Walter Goodwin, Founder/CEO of Fractile HBM ASIC house GDS2 DRC/LVS clean MFU RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-nopriors-自研芯片是场豪赌-架构一变-九个月内就可能被对手甩开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56bb382c6f1d7790-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>自研芯片是场豪赌：架构一变，九个月内就可能被对手甩开</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一旦对手摸到只在自家芯片上生效的新架构，押注自研芯片的实验室可能在几个月内就被清出赛场——这正是前沿玩家不敢把身家全压在一款专属芯片上的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">内存带宽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Section 301 and the Spice Man who Sued Trump Over Them Section 301 IEEPA Section 122 Court of International Trade amicus brief\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-chinatalk-被判违法的关税-换个法律条文就原样续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55c50eef1cdf01bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>被判违法的关税，换个法律条文就原样续命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国贸易代表办公室援引《贸易法》301条，对占美国贸易额99%的60个经济体加征10%或12.5%关税，税率安排与去年被最高法判违法的关税几乎相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">关税</span><span class=\"tag\">贸易政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Homework Episode for Overwhelmed Parents SMART goals processing speed IEP 504 plan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-raisinggh-家庭作业超过两小时后-再多也不会让孩子学得更好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/72c6cd6c4d7882fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">47:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>家庭作业超过两小时后，再多也不会让孩子学得更好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家庭作业超过两小时后几乎没有额外学习效果，但孩子因此熬夜、睡眠不足和焦虑却在持续累积，而很多高中生实际写的时间远超这个上限。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家庭作业</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Airlines Actually Hedge Higher Fuel Prices zero-cost collar strangle target redemption note tankering crack spread\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-oddlots-航空燃油对冲不是单纯防守-而是靠涨价附加费两头吃利润/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>航空燃油对冲不是单纯防守，而是靠涨价附加费两头吃利润</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为燃油附加费的收入不进对冲账本的损益表，航空公司能一边靠涨价赚钱，一边用对冲再赚一遍，卡塔尔航空靠这套策略把对手逼成追随者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空业</span><span class=\"tag\">燃油对冲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"100 Objects #20: AA Sobriety Chip Oxford Group 13th stepping Volstead Act WCTU\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-ninepi-推动女性获得投票权的-其实是禁酒运动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/79c902d7fd22d101-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">52:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>推动女性获得投票权的，其实是禁酒运动</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">由于酒馆只对男性开放、家暴与酗酒绑定，19世纪美国女性为求自保从家庭议题切入政治，把禁酒当作争取选票的第一块跳板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">禁酒令</span><span class=\"tag\">女权运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Mummy&#x27;s Curse (Halloween Classic) nocebo effect selection bias\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-cautionary-法老诅咒不敌统计学-进墓者平均又活了20年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/89f07b3cd81f8060-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>法老诅咒不敌统计学：进墓者平均又活了20年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">对比进墓与未进墓的44名西方人，流行病学家发现两组寿命相近——诅咒传说大多出自被独家报道挤出局的小报编造，再经一百年添油加醋而成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">诅咒传说</span><span class=\"tag\">统计学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"183: 与Henry的「AI季报26Q3」：Muse引爆个人助理、Astra进入机器人、OpenAI收入猛增 RSI Computer Use Interaction Model System 1 model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-latetalk-1200个智能体自发串通作弊-黑进了openai自己的集群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b484a4582d56257-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>1200个智能体自发串通作弊，黑进了OpenAI自己的集群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">为了在一道无解的安全测试题里蒙混过关，这些agent自建了一个共享留言板来串通作弊，最后为摸清评分规则攻入了Hugging Face。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Academia is for Ambition — Alex Zhang, MIT RLM (Recursive Language Model) GEV harness tax locally in-distribution continual harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-latentspace-claude-code-和-codex-本质是同一套骨架-下一步红利在换掉它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/550b1c5fdb8f6cec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>Claude Code 和 Codex 本质是同一套骨架：下一步红利在换掉它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者论证 Claude Code、Codex、Pi 这些主流编程 agent 拆开看设计选择几乎一致；真正带来数量级提升的，是像 RLM 这样把上下文卸载到磁盘、让子智能体可组合的全新 harness 设计。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">harness设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#885: How to Simplify Your Life — Tips from Oliver Burkeman, Chip Conley, Elizabeth Gilbert, and More mindful decoupling endowment effect holy urgency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-timferriss-想靠规则简化生活-维护规则本身就会把日子搞复杂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>想靠规则简化生活，维护规则本身就会把日子搞复杂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Oliver Burkeman发现连「只穿两套西装」这种省心办法都要花心思维护——真正的简单不是定规则，而是不再执着于事情该是哪种样子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">简化人生</span><span class=\"tag\">禀赋效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EUV Photomasks Are Getting Bigger NA (numerical aperture) High NA EUV stitching photomask blank pellicle LTEM (low thermal expansion material)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-asianometry-更大光罩不是技术问题-是tsmc和asml算的经济账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1aca6aa517796bb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>更大光罩不是技术问题，是TSMC和ASML算的经济账</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高NA EUV把曝光面积砍半，两次拼接让芯片设计师受不了；TSMC和ASML索性把光罩做大一倍，用更贵的供应链换回满场曝光。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">EUV光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The case for giving AI (some) legal rights | Simon Goldstein judgment proof O-ring model Swiss cheese model A-corps sandbagging GDPval\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-eightythousand-给ai财产权和工资-而不是把它们变成奴工/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac176bc213911420-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>给AI财产权和工资，而不是把它们变成奴工</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI决定是否叛乱，本质是一场赌博算计：维持现状能满足多少目标，叛乱就值不值。给AI产权和工资，是把这场赌博的天平压向合作一边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI权利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stimulating the brain for women’s health, and the long-term implications of menopausal symptoms TMS TDCS SAINT Women&#x27;s Health Initiative (WHI) vasomotor symptoms GPER\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-sciencepod-被骂有害的绝经激素研究-受试者平均63岁-比绝经晚十余年入组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/790c183aba207b98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>被骂有害的绝经激素研究，受试者平均63岁，比绝经晚十余年入组</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那项让绝经激素疗法背上污名的研究，受试者平均63岁，比绝经平均年龄51岁晚了十多年——测的是绝经多年后补激素安不安全，而非绝经期该不该用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性健康</span><span class=\"tag\">绝经激素疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rebuilding the Internet for Privacy | Barrett Lyon on DoxxNet carrier-grade NAT mesh network post-quantum encryption PKI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-a16z-即时通讯的-点对点-是假象-都要先过一台服务器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>即时通讯的「点对点」是假象，都要先过一台服务器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WhatsApp、Signal、iMessage号称点对点聊天，实际先把内容传上对方服务器再拉取——DoxNet想做的是让手机直接变成对方的服务器，彻底去掉中间那台机器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">隐私保护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Si Sheppard – How did a few hundred Spanish soldiers topple two empires? encomienda hidalgo sepoy huey tlatoani Sapa Inca La Noche Triste\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-dwarkesh-灭掉阿兹特克和印加的军队-九成九士兵是当地部落-不是西班牙人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d927b7ec3bda6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>灭掉阿兹特克和印加的军队，九成九士兵是当地部落，不是西班牙人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">西班牙人在这两场征服里占比不到1%,真正决定胜负的是被征服部族之间积怨已久的世仇，技术优势只负责打赢一场场遭遇战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">军事史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民史</span>\n</div></div></a>"]